/**
 * The stack page's Madhubani-style art, as SVG markup. Generated, then checked in: the drawings are original,
 * built from simple shapes, and coloured by the palette through the classes in styles/stack.css
 * (mb-s outline, mb-fa accent, mb-fb link colour, mb-fp paper, mb-fi ink, mb-fh hatch, and so on).
 *
 * motifDefs holds the fill patterns and one <symbol id="mb-…"> per motif. painting is one long vertical
 * painting, like a sleeve tattoo: a dragon's body winds its whole length, with a motif in every bend, teeth down
 * both edges, and the period drawn twice so it can loop (the head meets the previous tail). frieze is the same
 * painting laid left to right for phones, with every motif kept upright.
 */

